 areer\, vocation and public image in sharp focus\, right as slow Pluto's s
 quare to that same point gets an extra push toward deeper change.\n\n🟢 
 If it feels right\, do:\n• Write down what you actually want your career
  to look like next\n• Have an honest talk about direction with someone w
 hose opinion you trust\n\n🟡 If you can\, avoid:\n• Sending your CV or
  announcing a big career move publicly right now\n• Signing any work con
 tract before mid-November\, when Mercury clears its shadow\n\n🟣 → Mer
 cury is still in its shadow until November 13 and Venus is retrograde unti
 l November 14\, so this is a moment to think your career image through\, n
 ot to launch it. What does your work or public image need you to finally s
 ay out loud?\n\n🔵 Aspect: ☿ (9°27' Scorpio\, in house 10) ☌ Midhea
 ven natal (9°27' Scorpio\, in house 10) · exact 08/10 03:51\nHow it conn
 ects: origin in houses 2 and 10 → lived in house 10 → influences house
 s 5\, 6 and 8 (ruled by ☿) · house 10 (ruled by ♇) · classical: hous
 es 3 and 10 (ruled by ♂)\n\n—\nIris Calendar\n🐝 Updated on 08 Oct 2
 026\nhttps://mi-calendario-astral.netlify.app
