DESCRIPTION:🟠 This month opens with Venus retrograde facing your natal 
 Sun\, pulling up old questions about love\, home and how you present yours
 elf\, right as the Sun lights up your career house — the tension between
  what you want to be known for and what you actually feel at home is the t
 hread running through November. Mercury turns retrograde too\, sending you
  back into old beliefs\, studies or travel plans before both planets stati
 on direct around November 11-13 and slowly retrace their steps through the
  end of the month. A Scorpio New Moon on November 9 plants a career intent
 ion right where Venus retrograde opposes your Sun\, asking you to redefine
  who you're becoming before acting on it. Several grand water trines (Sun 
 and Mercury with your Moon and Jupiter) make your instincts and words flow
  with real ease\, especially around career conversations. The Full Moon on
  November 24 lands in your home house while the Sun sits in career\, with 
 Mars pushing tension from partnerships and Uranus adding a sudden twist 
 — home and work pull at each other again.\n\nIn the background\, Pluto k
 eeps squaring your Pluto and Midheaven at peak strength\, the first hit of
  a lifelong process asking you to build real authority instead of reacting
  to power struggles. A second Pluto square\, to your Sun and North Node\, 
 is in its last and most conscious pass\, closing a long inherited theme ab
 out identity and direction. Neptune squares your natal Neptune and Mars at
  its first peak\, testing how dreams meet real drive. Saturn's square to y
 our Moon is finishing its last pass\, done reviewing old emotional pattern
 s\, while its square to Mars gets a second exact hit on November 5\, askin
 g you to build structure around frustration and desire.\n\n→ With Pluto 
 pressing your identity and career point while Mars prepares for its own re
 trograde review in shared resources\, what part of your public ambition is
  ready to be rebuilt on your own terms\, not inherited ones?\n\nYou will f
 ind more information and detail in the events of November in your calendar
 . Happy November! ✨\n\n—\nIris Calendar\n🐝 Updated on 08 Oct 2026\n
